y":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $909M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 34.5%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 2.93"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":212.61,"default_fair_val":212.61,"premium_pct":186.6,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":38.4,"pe_forward":33.8,"pb_trailing":25.6,"pb_forward":23,"div_yield":0.52,"ps_ratio":10.1,"fcf_to_ev":2.5,"fcf_to_mcap":2.46,"liab_to_assets":34.5,"cash_to_assets":27.8,"current_ratio":2.93,"roe":66.7,"roa":43.7,"moat":{"ticker":"UI","period":"2026Q4","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的品牌價值主要體現在其專業級網路設備的性價比上，吸引了大量中小企業和專業用戶。雖然其產品性能優越，但相較於思科等傳統巨頭，其品牌溢價能力仍有提升空間。公司透過提供高性價比的解決方案，在特定市場建立了穩固的客戶群，但面對激烈的市場競爭，其定價權並非絕對，更多是依賴於產品的價值主張來獲取市場份額。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti's brand strength lies in its high-performance, cost-effective networking solutions, appealing to SMBs and prosumers. While its products offer superior performance, its brand premium is not as pronounced as established giants like Cisco. The company has built a loyal customer base through its value proposition, but pricing power is not absolute due to intense market competition. Its moat is more about delivering superior value than commanding premium prices."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的技術創新主要透過其專有的 UniFi 軟體平台和硬體設計實現，而非依賴大量的專利壁壘。公司在通訊設備領域的運營，雖然受到一定的行業標準和認證約束，但並無顯著的監管特許或專利保護構成強大的護城河。其競爭優勢更多來自於快速迭代和整合的產品生態系統，而非法律或監管保護。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti's innovation stems more from its proprietary UniFi software platform and hardware designs rather than extensive patent protection. While operating in the communication equipment sector involves industry standards and certifications, there are no significant regulatory licenses or patent barriers forming a strong moat. Its competitive edge comes from rapid iteration and an integrated product ecosystem, not legal or regulatory exclusivity."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的 UniFi 平台創造了顯著的轉換成本。一旦客戶採用了 UniFi 的控制器和生態系統，包括交換機、接入點、路由器和攝像頭等，遷移到其他品牌的系統將涉及重大的時間、金錢和技術投入。UniFi 的集中管理軟體和無縫集成特性，使得用戶高度依賴該平台，從而形成了強大的客戶黏性與轉換壁壘。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti's UniFi platform creates substantial switching costs. Once customers adopt the UniFi controller and ecosystem, integrating switches, access points, routers, and cameras, migrating to another brand requires significant investment in time, money, and technical expertise. The centralized management software and seamless integration features foster high customer dependency on the platform, establishing a strong retention barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的 UniFi 平台展現了溫和的網絡效應。隨著更多用戶採用 UniFi 設備，平台的使用數據和反饋有助於軟體的持續優化和新功能的開發，進一步提升了產品的吸引力。同時，一個龐大的 UniFi 用戶社區也提供了豐富的資源和支持，增強了用戶體驗。雖然不是典型的病毒式網絡效應，但其生態系統的協同效應和用戶群的擴大確實增強了其競爭地位。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti's UniFi platform exhibits moderate network effects. As more users adopt UniFi devices, usage data and feedback contribute to software optimization and new feature development, enhancing product appeal. A large UniFi user community also provides extensive resources and support, improving the user experience. While not a classic viral network effect, the ecosystem's synergy and growing user base strengthen its competitive position."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 在通訊設備製造領域，透過其高效的供應鏈管理和規模化生產，建立了顯著的成本優勢。公司專注於提供高性價比的產品，這得益於其精簡的營運模式和對成本控制的嚴格要求。這種規模經濟使其能夠以低於競爭對手的價格提供同等甚至更高質量的產品，從而在市場上獲得競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti leverages its efficient supply chain management and scaled manufacturing in the communication equipment sector to achieve a significant cost advantage. The company's focus on high-value, cost-effective products is underpinned by its lean operational model and stringent cost controls. This economies of scale allows it to offer comparable or superior quality products at lower prices than competitors, securing a competitive edge in the market."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的業務模式並未嚴重依賴特定的地理位置或獨特的實體資產來構建其護城河。其產品的設計、製造和銷售遍布全球，並無顯著的地理壟斷或稀缺資產。公司的核心競爭力在於其技術和商業模式，而非地理上的優勢。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti's business model does not rely heavily on specific geographic locations or unique physical assets for its moat. Its product design, manufacturing, and sales are global, without significant geographic monopolies or scarce assets. The company's core competencies lie in its technology and business model, rather than geographical advantages."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 在營運效率方面表現極為出色，其精簡的組織架構、高效的研發流程和對成本的嚴格控制，使其能夠以極低的營運費用提供高質量的產品。公司透過直接面向客戶的銷售模式和對供應鏈的精準把控，實現了卓越的利潤率和資產周轉率，這構成了其強大的競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency through its lean organizational structure, streamlined R&D processes, and rigorous cost controls, enabling it to deliver high-quality products with remarkably low operating expenses. Its direct-to-customer sales model and precise supply chain management result in superior profit margins and asset turnover, forming a formidable competitive barrier."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的管理層在資本配置方面展現了卓越的智慧和紀律。公司持續將自由現金流投入到研發和產品創新中，同時保持極低的負債水平和充裕的現金儲備。其對股東回報的承諾，以及在擴張和回購方面的審慎決策，都體現了長期價值的追求，為股東創造了可觀的回報。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti's management exhibits exceptional wisdom and discipline in capital allocation. The company consistently reinvests free cash flow into R&D and product innovation while maintaining very low debt levels and ample cash reserves. Its commitment to shareholder returns, coupled with prudent decisions in expansion and share repurchases, reflects a pursuit of long-term value creation for shareholders."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的 UniFi 生態系統透過其無縫集成和易用性，實現了高度的客戶留存。一旦用戶習慣了 UniFi 的管理界面和跨設備的協同工作能力，轉換到其他系統的意願就會大大降低。持續的軟體更新和不斷擴展的產品線，也進一步鞏固了客戶關係，使得客戶更傾向於在現有生態系統內進行追加購買。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti achieves high customer retention through the seamless integration and ease of use of its UniFi ecosystem. Once users become accustomed to the UniFi management interface and cross-device synergy, their willingness to switch to other systems diminishes significantly. Continuous software updates and an expanding product line further solidify customer relationships, encouraging repeat purchases within the existing ecosystem."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Ubiquiti 的商業模式具有相當的持久性，其 UniFi 平台和對性價比的專注，使其能夠在不斷變化的科技市場中保持競爭力。雖然通訊設備行業技術迭代迅速，但其建立的轉換成本和客戶忠誠度，為公司提供了一定的緩衝。只要公司能持續創新並維持其成本優勢，其護城河就能保持相對穩固。","comment_en":"Ubiquiti's business model possesses considerable durability. Its UniFi platform and focus on value-for-money enable it to remain competitive in the ever-evolving tech landscape. Despite rapid technological advancements in the communication equipment sector, the switching costs and customer loyalty it has built provide a degree of resilience. As long as the company continues to innovate and maintain its cost advantage, its moat is likely to remain relatively robust."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Ubiquiti 展現了強大的經濟護城河，主要體現在其 UniFi 平台的轉換成本（M3）和客戶留存（M9）上，這使得用戶高度依賴其生態系統。此外，公司在規模成本（M5）和營運效率（M7）方面也表現出色，能夠提供高性價比的產品。管理層卓越的資本配置（M8）能力，持續為股東創造價值。雖然其品牌定價權（M1）和專利壁壘（M2）相對較弱，且不依賴地理優勢（M6），但其綜合競爭力足以構成一個類似於「收費橋」的商業模式，即一旦進入其生態系統，用戶便難以離開，並持續為公司貢獻營收。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Ubiquiti possesses a strong economic moat, primarily driven by high switching costs (M3) and customer retention (M9) within its UniFi platform, creating significant ecosystem dependency. The company also excels in cost advantages from scale (M5) and operational efficiency (M7), enabling it to offer compelling value. Exceptional capital allocation (M8) by management consistently enhances shareholder value. While brand pricing power (M1) and patent barriers (M2) are less pronounced, and it doesn't rely on geographic advantages (M6), its overall competitive strength resembles a 'toll bridge' model. Once customers are within its ecosystem, exiting is difficult, ensuring sustained revenue generation for the company.","evidenceHash":"32f98544577f945d3a6eae4cade0f2d86d20e4e4d9529fdd6c342069d0bd5f5b","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:24:37.317Z","evidenceHash":"87cd0ad417274280477bc4af6233e0a0876ccbb78a62cd9755027501d6d592b2"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2026-06-30","period":"FY 2026","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:24:37.317Z","evidenceHash":"87cd0ad417274280477bc4af6233e0a0876ccbb78a62cd9755027501d6d592b2"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UI.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UI.png","website":"https://www.ui.com","ceo":"Robert J. Pera","full_time_employees":"1818","description":"Ubiquiti Inc. develops networking technology for service providers, enterprises, and consumers in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Asia Pacific, South America. The company develops technology platforms for high-capacity distributed Internet access, unified information technology, and consumer electronics for professional, home, and personal use. Its service provider product platforms offer carrier-class network infrastructure for fixed wireless broadband, wireless backhaul systems, and routing and related software; and enterprise product platforms provide wireless LAN infrastructure, video surveillance products, switching and routing solutions, security gateways, door access systems, and other WLAN products. It also provides technology platforms, such as UniFi Cloud Gateway, an Enterprise class internet and security gateway device; UniFi Wi-Fi, an enterprise Wi-Fi system; UniFi Protect, a video surveillance platform; UniFi Switch that deliver performance, switching, and power of ethernet support for enterprise networks; UniFi Access, a door access solution; UniFi Talk, a plug-and-play phone system and VoIP subscription service, as well as UniFi Connect and its AmpliFi platform. In addition, the company offers airMAX, which include proprietary protocols that contain technologies for minimizing signal noise; airFiber, a wireless backhauls point-to-point radio system; UFiber GPON, a plug and play fiber network technology to build high speed fiber internet networks; and Wave, a technology platform. Further, the company provides base stations, radios, backhaul equipment, and customer premise equipment; embedded radio products; and antennas. It serves customers through a network of distributors, online retailers, and direct to customers through webstores. The company was formerly known as Ubiquiti Networks, Inc. and changed its name to Ubiquiti Inc. in August 2019. Ubiquiti Inc. was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","description_en":"Ubiquiti Inc. develops networking technology for service providers, enterprises, and consumers in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Asia Pacific, South America. The company develops technology platforms for high-capacity distributed Internet access, unified information technology, and consumer electronics for professional, home, and personal use. Its service provider product platforms offer carrier-class network infrastructure for fixed wireless broadband, wireless backhaul systems, and routing and related software; and enterprise product platforms provide wireless LAN infrastructure, video surveillance products, switching and routing solutions, security gateways, door access systems, and other WLAN products. It also provides technology platforms, such as UniFi Cloud Gateway, an Enterprise class internet and security gateway device; UniFi Wi-Fi, an enterprise Wi-Fi system; UniFi Protect, a video surveillance platform; UniFi Switch that deliver performance, switching, and power of ethernet support for enterprise networks; UniFi Access, a door access solution; UniFi Talk, a plug-and-play phone system and VoIP subscription service, as well as UniFi Connect and its AmpliFi platform. In addition, the company offers airMAX, which include proprietary protocols that contain technologies for minimizing signal noise; airFiber, a wireless backhauls point-to-point radio system; UFiber GPON, a plug and play fiber network technology to build high speed fiber internet networks; and Wave, a technology platform. Further, the company provides base stations, radios, backhaul equipment, and customer premise equipment; embedded radio products; and antennas. It serves customers through a network of distributors, online retailers, and direct to customers through webstores. The company was formerly known as Ubiquiti Networks, Inc. and changed its name to Ubiquiti Inc. in August 2019. Ubiquiti Inc. was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","description_zh":"**Ubiquiti Inc. (UI) 業務營運精煉報告**\n\nUbiquiti Inc. 是一家全球性的網路技術開發商，專注於為北美、歐洲、中東、非洲、亞太及南美地區的服務供應商、企業及消費者提供創新解決方案。公司核心業務圍繞三大技術平台：高容量分散式網際網路接入、統一資訊科技以及專業級消費性電子產品。\n\n其服務供應商產品線涵蓋電信級網路基礎設施，包括固定無線寬頻、無線回傳系統，以及路由與相關軟體。企業級產品則提供無線區域網路 (WLAN) 基礎設施、視訊監控、交換與路由解決方案、安全閘道器、門禁系統等。\n\nUbiquiti 的關鍵技術平台包括：UniFi 系列，提供企業級網際網路與安全閘道器 (UniFi Cloud Gateway)、Wi-Fi 系統 (UniFi Wi-Fi)、視訊監控平台 (UniFi Protect)、交換器 (UniFi Switch)、門禁解決方案 (UniFi Access) 及 VoIP 電話系統 (UniFi Talk)；以及 airMAX 